<title>FRANCE: Sagem H1 profit up 17.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Sagem H1 profit up 17.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			   267.5  vs	   228.2</p>
<p>    Global net result			  327.7  vs	   284.0</p>
<p>    Operating				    587.4  up     13.1 pct</p>
<p>    Turnover				   7,670    up	3.7 pct</p>
<p>Note - French electronics company Sagem gave the results in a statement</p>
</text>
